Blog articles live here, one markdown file per article.

The editor at /admin writes them; they can equally be added by hand. The file
name becomes the URL, so make it the keyword phrase and never change it after
publishing - a published URL must not move without a 301 (spec 5.2).

The six-month content plan is section 12 of the build specification: 24 articles
in priority order, each with its target search phrase and what must be in it.
Article 1, "What an offshore bookkeeper actually costs a CPA firm in 2026", is
the highest-intent search in the category.
